16392050,2025-10-06,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I recently obtained my credit report and found information that is inaccurate and harmful to my credit history. Specifically, my credit file contains an account ( XXXX XXXX, Account No. XXXX ) that I never authorized to be reported, nor did I give my consent for it to be furnished to any credit reporting agency. 

