16578797,2025-10-14,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"I am filing this complaint against TransUnion LLC for multiple violations of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) related to their handling of a disputed timeshare account. TransUnion has failed to correct inaccurate reporting and has also failed to comply with FCRA procedural requirements for dispute investigations. 

