16626385,2025-10-16,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Domestic (US) money transfer,Other transaction problem,,"Early Warning Services, LLCAttn : Zelle Network Dispute DepartmentXXXX N. XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, AZ XXXX Subject : Request for Review and Removal of Adverse Report False Unauthorized Zelle Claim Dear Early Warning Services Dispute Department, I am writing to formally resubmit my complaint, as instructed by a representative I spoke with today XXXX at XXXX :, regarding a Zelle transaction in the amount of {$100.00} that was sent to me on XX/XX/year>. This transaction was made knowingly and willingly by the sender, yet was later maliciously and falsely reported as unauthorized, constituting an abuse of the Zelle dispute system. 
