16641834,2025-10-16,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Investigation took more than 30 days,"I am filing this formal complaint against Equifax Information Services, LLC for willfully and negligently violating the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( 15 U.S.C. 1681i ).

