16709539,2025-10-20,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"Subject : Formal Request for Method of Verification ( MOV ) & Temporary Suppression Under FCRA 1. Formal Demand for Reinvestigation This letter serves as my formal request under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) 611 ( 15 U.S.C. 1681i ) for a detailed Method of Verification ( MOV ) regarding specific disputed accounts on my credit report. I previously disputed these items, yet they remain on my report. I am now demanding full compliance with federal law, including the temporary suppression of these accounts while the investigation is ongoing.

