16872831,2025-10-28,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"I discovered approximately {$120000.00} in unauthorized transactions from my SoFi account to multiple cryptocurrency platforms while I was out of the country on military contract work, said works prohibit the use of electronics such as computers and cell phones. I promptly reported the unauthorized transactions to SoFi Bank well within the 60-day timeframe required under Regulation E 1005.6 ( b ) ( 1 ) after returning home and checking my account. 

