16880583,2025-10-28,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I recently reviewed my credit report and found something that really concerns me. There's an account reporting ( XXXX, XXXX ) that I never authorized. I didn't open it, I didn't give permission for it to appear on my file, and I definitely didn't consent to have it reported to any credit bureau.

