16902242,2025-10-29,"Payday loan, title loan, personal loan, or advance loan",Personal line of credit,Problem with additional add-on products or services,,"This complaint concerns Afterpay US , Inc. and their improper handling of a transaction dispute involving the fraudulent merchant XXXX ( XXXX XXXX ). 

